  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engagement Facility to Enhance Efficiency and Effectiveness of Country Programme Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Engagement Facility provides a rapid and flexible mechanism to support the effective delivery of the UNDP Country Programme by enabling upstream policy engagement, analytical work, innovation testing, and timely response to emerging needs.The Facility will be used to enhance programme efficiency and effectiveness by supporting targeted analytical studies, short-term technical expertise, learning events, innovation pilots, and South-South cooperation initiatives that contribute directly to CP</narrative>
  </description>
